---
// A line icon drawn in the text color. The star is a filled shape, which the layout fills with
// --star in the plugin page's repo line and with the count's color on the home table. It
// is hidden from screen readers, so the link around it, or the labeled control or text beside
// it, carries the words.
//
// The paths come from Lucide (https://lucide.dev) and from the Feather icons that it includes.
// Some are unchanged. Others round the numbers, write a shape as a path, or redraw a small part.
// The puzzle path is unchanged from lucide-static 1.68.0, and the layout fills it for the logo.
// site/public/favicon.svg draws the same path.
